5,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Since we have no information yet, I suggest we observe each other's communication patterns. Let's keep the conversation open and see how everyone reacts.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,May,,"That sounds a bit too formal, Asuka! Let's just have some fun and get to know each other. I'm sure we'll spot the wolf in no time!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Rin,,I'm so excited! This is like a real mystery adventure! I'll use my super-detective skills to find the werewolf! Hehe!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree with Asuka. While enthusiasm is fine, we must remain objective. I'll be looking for any contradictions in our statements as the game progresses.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,A logical approach is the only one that works. I'll be observing from the sidelines to see who tries to steer the narrative too early.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@May, your playfulness is noted, but remember that a cheerful mask can be a convenient cover. I'll be paying attention to that.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,May,,"Oh, you're so serious! I'm just trying to keep the mood light. @Rin, do you think we can find the wolf together?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,Yes! We'll be the best detective team ever! I bet the wolf is trying to act all calm and scary right now!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, remember that the wolf might not act scary at all. They will likely try to blend in and appear as helpful as possible.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,Exactly. The most effective deception is the one that mirrors the majority. I'm curious to see who among us is the best actor.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, you seem very confident in your observational skills. I wonder if you have a specific method for identifying the possessed as well?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,May,,Maybe Shion is just trying to sound cool! Hehe. I think we should just trust our gut feelings for the first day.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Rin,,Gut feelings are great! But I also want to see if anyone gets nervous when we ask them questions!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Minako,,"Trusting guts is risky, May. We need a strategy. I suggest we wait for the Seer's first result tomorrow before making any accusations.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,I agree with Minako. There is no point in guessing now. I shall simply enjoy watching the dynamics unfold.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Asuka,,It seems we have a general consensus to observe for now. I will retire for the night. Good luck to the Seer.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
