36,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"Good morning. The first night has passed. Since the Seer now has information, I will be direct: May is the werewolf.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,May,,"What?! Asuka, that's a huge accusation! Why would you say that so suddenly? I'm just a regular girl!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Wow! A reveal on the first day! That's so exciting! Is it really true, Asuka? Is May the big bad wolf?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, claiming the Seer role and identifying the wolf immediately is a bold move. It could be the truth, or a very aggressive play by the wolf.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Interesting. A direct strike. If Asuka is the Seer, the game ends quickly. If she's the wolf, she's trying to eliminate May to gain trust.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I am the Seer. I have no reason to lie and risk my position. May's reaction is exactly what I expected from a werewolf.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,May,,"I can't believe this! I've been nothing but nice! @Minako, @Shion, you can't possibly believe her just because she says she's the Seer!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Rin,,"But Asuka seems so sure! And she's always so logical. I think she's telling the truth! Sorry, May!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, if you are the Seer, you've given us a clear target. However, we must consider if the Possessed is trying to protect May.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@May, your desperation is palpable. While Asuka's claim is sudden, it is logically consistent with a Seer wanting to end the game efficiently.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, I appreciate your analysis. The village should not hesitate. Executing May now is the most logical path to victory.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
