48,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm sorry May, but Asuka's ""detective"" vibe is too strong! I'm voting for the wolf!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Minako,,I have no reason to doubt Asuka's conviction. Her behavior is consistent with her personality. I will support the execution.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Shion,,I find Asuka's claim more credible than May's denial. The evidence of the Seer's divination outweighs a plea for mercy.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
